---
---
<section class="bg-dark-background py-20" data-ps="security-services-pa/SecurityServicesLeader.astro">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Jarrod Emes -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="text-primary font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-3">
          [ Owner & President ]
        </p>
        <h2
          class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-dark-foreground mb-2"
          style="font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: 1.1;"
        >
          Jarrod Emes
        </h2>
        <p class="text-primary font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-6">
          Owner and President
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-dark-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Jarrod is a graduate of Alvernia College, where he earned a Bachelor's degree in Criminal Justice with a Minor in Sociology. In 2007, he was honored with the Saint Michael Archangel Award. Jarrod also served as a "Program Advisory Board Member" for the Criminal Justice Department at Berks Technical Institute.
          </p>
          <p>
            His professional background includes being a member of the KRE Security/Investigations Inc. Management Team from 2007 to 2016 and becoming the Owner of KRE Security LLC in 2016. Jarrod is a certified instructor in American Heart CPR, First Aid, Phazzer Non-Lethal Training, and PA Act 235 Lethal Weapon Agent certification.
          </p>
          <p>
            Jarrod's work experience spans over 20 years in the Emergency Services field, specializing in Fire/Rescue and Emergency Management. He currently oversees municipal hazard plans, mitigation projects, and ongoing safety assessments. His previous roles include working at the Berks County Juvenile Detention Center, the Berks County Department of Emergency Services as a Special Projects Officer, and serving as a Deputy Coroner for the Schuylkill County Coroner's Office.
          </p>
          <p>
            With over 15 years of experience at KRE Security/Investigations Inc., and 6 years as the proud owner, Jarrod remains deeply committed to client service. As Owner and President, he works directly with clients on a daily basis and is always available 24/7, 365 days a year.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="tel:16105620971"
            class="inline-block bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-6 py-3 border-2 border-primary hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors duration-150"
          >
            610-562-0971
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:kre.scheduling@gmail.com"
            class="inline-block bg-transparent text-dark-foreground font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-6 py-3 border-2 border-dark-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-150"
          >
            Email Us Here
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Photo + associations -->
      <div class="space-y-6 reveal-right">
        <div class="tactical-frame overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/image-4-320.webp"
            alt="Jarrod Emes - Owner and President of KRE Security"
            class="w-full max-w-[320px] mx-auto h-auto object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="tactical-frame bg-background p-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/63861c_3d55985869664c34bf4dcf7b0625f951~mv2-200.webp"
              alt="Alvernia University logo"
              class="max-w-[200px] w-full h-auto object-contain"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="tactical-frame bg-background p-4 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/63861c_2bdb9acc9da64a9b9c0ce4c17beeb8d2~mv2-292.webp"
              alt="Union Fire Co Hamburg"
              class="max-w-[120px] w-full h-auto object-contain"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-dark-border p-5">
          <p class="text-primary font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-2">[ Class Alumni ]</p>
          <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Jarrod is a graduate of Alvernia College, where he earned a Bachelor's degree in Criminal Justice. In 2007, he was honored with the Saint Michael Archangel Award. He served as a "Program Advisory Board Member" for the Criminal Justice Department at Berks Technical Institute.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
